+    returning true.
+
+New Procedures and Functions
+
+    None.
+
+Errors
+
+    None.
+
+New Tokens
+
+    Accepted by the <target> parameter of BeginQueryEXT, EndQueryEXT,
+    and GetQueryObjectuivEXT:
+
+        PROGRAM_COMPLETION_QUERY_CHROMIUM                     0x6009
+
+New State
+
+    None.
+
